# Thermal Gas Mixer ABI1. d0 hot,d1 cold,d2 out,d3 mixer,d4 condition.
poke 0 31416050
poke 1 1
poke 2 0
Loop:
yield
bdns d4 Bad
get r15 d4 11
blez r15 Bad
get r0 d4 0
bne r0 31416048 Bad
get r0 d4 12
bne r0 1 Bad
get r0 d4 10
beqz r0 Off
get r3 d4 4
get r4 d4 6
get r5 d4 7
get r0 d4 11
bne r0 r15 Loop
move r6 r4
blez r5 Target
blt r5 100000 Avg
j Target
Avg:
add r6 r4 r5
div r6 r6 2
Target:
bdnvl d0 Temperature Bad
bdnvl d1 Temperature Bad
l r7 d0 Temperature
l r8 d1 Temperature
blez r7 Bad
blez r8 Bad
sub r9 r8 r7
beqz r9 Bad
mul r10 r7 r8
